{
  "name": "TED Tenders Scraper (EU Public Procurement Notices) — daily results to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (2 minutes)\n1. **Apify credential** — in the `Run the Actor` node create a *Header Auth* credential: header `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` (<https://console.apify.com/account/integrations>). The token lives in your n8n credential, never in this file.\n2. **Google Sheet** — in `Append rows to Google Sheet` paste your spreadsheet URL and tab name, and pick the Google credential n8n asks for.\n3. **Input** — edit the JSON body of `Run the Actor` (see the README), then activate.\n\nWorkflow by [Steadfetch](https://apify.com/steadfetch) — *web data that doesn't break*.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ba6aaf7f-e2b6-5cac-85b4-150994b326dd",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -780,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ef708a80-5157-5bbc-b5bd-a4226bb64aff",
      "name": "Every morning at 07:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -560,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/steadfetch~ted-tender-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"source\": \"all\",\n  \"queries\": [{\"text\": \"software\"}],\n  \"maxResults\": 10,\n  \"monitorMode\": false\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "ba57dcb3-5410-5787-ab5a-5540b7317e54",
      "name": "Run the Actor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -280,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 10000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {},
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Sheet1"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/PASTE_YOUR_SHEET_URL"
        }
      },
      "id": "18bffc33-e031-5020-96f2-c46834e86b73",
      "name": "Append rows to Google Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every morning at 07:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run the Actor",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run the Actor": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Append rows to Google Sheet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "active": false
}
